      <h3 id="_apisconfigopenshiftiov1clusterimagepolicies" class="group scroll-mt-20">/apis/config.openshift.io/v1/clusterimagepolicies<a href="#_apisconfigopenshiftiov1clusterimagepolicies" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h3>
      <dl class="my-4 space-y-2">
      <dt class="font-semibold">HTTP method</dt>
